WEBVTT

00:00:02.730 --> 00:00:04.770
<i>Wealth, fame, power...</i>

00:00:04.770 --> 00:00:06.670
<i>Gold Roger,
the King of the Pirates,</i>

00:00:06.670 --> 00:00:08.970
<i>attained everything
this world has to offer.</i>

00:00:08.970 --> 00:00:12.840
<i>The words he uttered just before
his death drove people to the seas.</i>

00:00:12.840 --> 00:00:16.680
<i>My treasure? If you want it,
you can have it!</i>

00:00:16.680 --> 00:00:20.240
<i>Find it! I left everything
this world has to offer there!</i>

00:00:22.850 --> 00:00:27.590
<i>And so men head for the Grand Line
in pursuit of their dreams!</i>

00:00:27.590 --> 00:00:31.490
<i>The world has truly entered
a Great Pirate Era!</i>

00:00:31.490 --> 00:00:36.870
<i>We're going to gather up
all our dreams</i>

00:00:36.870 --> 00:00:42.770
<i>and set out in search
of something to find</i>

00:00:42.770 --> 00:00:44.100
<i>ONE PIECE!</i>

00:00:48.980 --> 00:00:54.620
<i>Compasses only cause delays</i>

00:00:54.620 --> 00:01:00.360
<i>Delirious with fever,
I take the helm</i>

00:01:00.360 --> 00:01:10.350
<i>If the dusty treasure map has
been verified, it's not a legend!</i>

00:01:12.470 --> 00:01:18.170
<i>When it comes to personal storms,</i>

00:01:18.170 --> 00:01:23.480
<i>simply ride aboard
someone else's biorhythm</i>

00:01:23.480 --> 00:01:27.150
<i>and pretend it isn't there!</i>

00:01:27.150 --> 00:01:32.650
<i>We're going to gather up
all our dreams</i>

00:01:32.650 --> 00:01:38.360
<i>and set out in search
of something to find</i>

00:01:38.360 --> 00:01:44.600
<i>A coin in my pocket,
and do you wanna be my friend?</i>

00:01:44.600 --> 00:01:49.970
<i>We are, We are on the cruise!</i>

00:01:49.970 --> 00:01:51.040
<i>We are!</i>

00:01:54.040 --> 00:01:57.950
You... damn caterpillar!!

00:02:06.390 --> 00:02:08.480
Chore boy!!

00:02:12.330 --> 00:02:16.260
Even if hundreds of
weapons are built in,

00:02:16.260 --> 00:02:21.570
he can be defeated by someone
with a spear of blind determination.

00:02:26.840 --> 00:02:29.850
At least...

00:02:29.850 --> 00:02:34.680
that kid doesn't have any hesitation.

00:02:34.680 --> 00:02:38.350
Is it a survival instinct?

00:02:38.350 --> 00:02:42.050
Or does he not fear death
because he has faith in himself?

00:02:44.030 --> 00:02:46.120
Faith...

00:02:49.360 --> 00:02:52.430
This is where you die!!

00:02:59.880 --> 00:03:03.810
M-my Mighty Battle Spear is...
What the hell did you do?!

00:03:03.810 --> 00:03:06.980
I gave it five punches.

00:03:06.980 --> 00:03:10.610
I guess that's it for your spear.

00:03:11.990 --> 00:03:13.990
That kid is pretty good.

00:03:13.990 --> 00:03:16.660
He might do it...

00:03:16.660 --> 00:03:18.490
This is bad...

00:03:18.490 --> 00:03:21.660
I never imagined the Mighty
Battle Spear would be broken...

00:03:26.330 --> 00:03:32.240
But he's taken that many explosions.
His body can't keep up...

00:03:43.020 --> 00:03:48.390
<i>"The Conclusion Of The Deadly Battle!
A Spear Of Blind Determination!"</i>

00:03:52.360 --> 00:03:55.360
--Prepare yourself...
--Huh?!

00:03:55.360 --> 00:03:58.560
This is a big enough foothold.

00:04:01.040 --> 00:04:04.970
With a foothold this size,
I can kick your ass.

00:04:04.970 --> 00:04:06.140
What?

00:04:06.140 --> 00:04:10.480
With the spear blade broken,
that's just a bomb on a stick.

00:04:10.480 --> 00:04:12.150
The power is cut by half.

00:04:12.150 --> 00:04:13.650
You think so?

00:04:13.650 --> 00:04:15.980
Yeah, I do.

00:04:15.980 --> 00:04:18.990
A bomb on a stick? So what of it?

00:04:18.990 --> 00:04:23.660
Given the shape you're in, it's more
than enough force to blow you away.

00:04:23.660 --> 00:04:25.830
With your body falling apart like that,

00:04:25.830 --> 00:04:29.000
whatever you say
sounds like just a bluff.

00:04:29.000 --> 00:04:31.590
It's not a bluff.

00:04:32.670 --> 00:04:38.510
Just give it up!
The moment you defied me,

00:04:38.510 --> 00:04:40.810
you signed your death warrant!

00:04:40.810 --> 00:04:43.510
I won't die! Bleah!

00:04:46.680 --> 00:04:48.520
Hey! I'm over here!

00:04:48.520 --> 00:04:51.020
That monkey!

00:04:51.020 --> 00:04:53.350
Ooh ooh ahh!

00:04:57.360 --> 00:04:59.950
He keeps hopping around!

00:05:04.300 --> 00:05:06.390
It's useless!

00:05:09.300 --> 00:05:12.370
Just how many built-in
weapons does he have?

00:05:21.650 --> 00:05:25.990
Gum-Gum... Gatling!

00:05:31.490 --> 00:05:35.000
--What's that?!
--Amazing...

00:05:35.000 --> 00:05:37.000
What the hell is that?

00:05:37.000 --> 00:05:39.170
I see a ton of arms...

00:05:39.170 --> 00:05:40.840
All right, chore boy!!

00:05:40.840 --> 00:05:42.960
Get him!!

00:05:59.020 --> 00:06:00.690
Weak!

00:06:00.690 --> 00:06:05.290
Your punches are powerless
against this Woots Steel Armor!

00:06:05.290 --> 00:06:08.820
You can't even make a dent in it.

00:06:11.130 --> 00:06:13.930
Gum-Gum Pistol!!

00:06:25.980 --> 00:06:28.510
Don!!

00:06:31.320 --> 00:06:33.480
How impudent!!

00:06:38.830 --> 00:06:42.330
Useless! Useless! How useless!!

00:06:42.330 --> 00:06:48.630
This armor won't break, even with
hundreds of monkey punches!

00:06:50.170 --> 00:06:53.730
I think I'm pretty close...

00:06:56.010 --> 00:06:58.010
He's gone...

00:06:58.010 --> 00:07:00.210
I'm right here!

00:07:04.620 --> 00:07:08.960
Now listen. The ultimate force
means the strongest equipment

00:07:08.960 --> 00:07:11.960
and the strongest power!

00:07:11.960 --> 00:07:17.590
The strong one is the one who survives.
The strong one is!

00:07:19.970 --> 00:07:24.310
Then, that'll be me! Gum-Gum...

00:07:24.310 --> 00:07:26.810
Useless! Useless! It's useless!!

00:07:26.810 --> 00:07:31.110
Even pride will only get you so far!

00:07:33.980 --> 00:07:37.540
Bazooka!!

00:07:46.160 --> 00:07:51.000
No good. This is all you can do.

00:07:53.670 --> 00:07:57.630
What?! The strongest
armor is cracking?!

00:07:59.670 --> 00:08:06.440
But it's too late.
You're done for, anchor boy!

00:08:09.450 --> 00:08:12.480
It's a trap! Get out!!

00:08:20.960 --> 00:08:23.590
Chore boy!!

00:08:39.650 --> 00:08:42.980
Is it a survival instinct?

00:08:42.980 --> 00:08:46.180
Or does he not fear death
because he has faith in himself?

00:08:49.490 --> 00:08:53.430
--Gum-Gum...
--What?!

00:08:56.000 --> 00:08:59.460
Bazooka!!

00:09:24.630 --> 00:09:28.320
--All right!!
--Good job!!
--You're the best, chore boy!!

00:09:29.960 --> 00:09:33.090
I win!!

00:09:36.300 --> 00:09:38.140
Don't get carried away, brat!!

00:09:38.140 --> 00:09:40.440
Ugh! He's still alive!

00:09:42.640 --> 00:09:44.550
Oh, no!

00:09:47.980 --> 00:09:51.890
Can you escape?! It's a steel net!

00:10:02.000 --> 00:10:06.000
Below us is the ocean.
The game is over, anchor boy!

00:10:06.000 --> 00:10:10.460
I'm the one who's
getting the last laugh!

00:10:13.680 --> 00:10:15.810
All right! That's our Don!

00:10:15.810 --> 00:10:18.840
--Make him fall!
--Get him!!

00:10:22.520 --> 00:10:25.690
If I can get my arms and legs out,
the game is mine!

00:10:25.690 --> 00:10:28.180
<i>Why doesn't he flinch?</i>

00:10:29.360 --> 00:10:32.690
<i>--Why does he go that far?
--What?!</i>

00:10:32.690 --> 00:10:37.430
This is gonna end it... for sure!

00:10:41.370 --> 00:10:45.100
Gum-Gum...

00:10:55.220 --> 00:10:57.450
Giant Gavel!!

00:11:20.010 --> 00:11:23.270
...Giant Gavel!!

00:11:44.530 --> 00:11:49.370
--Don Krieg...
--Don... Don was defeated! Why?!

00:11:49.370 --> 00:11:54.370
--Dammit! Why? Why was Don...
--All right, chore boy!!
--Good job!!

00:11:55.880 --> 00:11:59.210
--He really did it!!
--A-amazing!!

00:11:59.210 --> 00:12:02.480
Is this real? This is Don Krieg
we're talking about!

00:12:02.480 --> 00:12:07.160
<i>So strong! He's too strong!</i>

00:12:07.160 --> 00:12:09.320
Wh... What's all this fuss?

00:12:09.320 --> 00:12:11.660
Oh! You've come to!!

00:12:11.660 --> 00:12:15.000
He lost! Your Don lost!

00:12:15.000 --> 00:12:16.860
What?!

00:12:31.510 --> 00:12:35.680
If you have time to daydream,
go save that kid already!

00:12:35.680 --> 00:12:38.520
--Huh?
--He won't be floating up to the surface!

00:12:38.520 --> 00:12:40.020
What?!

00:12:40.020 --> 00:12:42.920
Those with the Devil Fruit power
are hated by the sea

00:12:42.920 --> 00:12:45.030
and lose the ability to swim.

00:12:45.030 --> 00:12:47.860
What'd you say, you damn geezer?!

00:12:47.860 --> 00:12:50.030
You should've told me that sooner!

00:12:50.030 --> 00:12:52.870
What're you gonna do if it's too late?!

00:13:10.990 --> 00:13:13.350
<i>Where did he go?</i>

00:13:43.020 --> 00:13:45.190
Hey! Hang in there!!

00:13:45.190 --> 00:13:48.520
<i>You said you wouldn't die, right?</i>

00:13:48.520 --> 00:13:53.360
<i>That's your faith, right?!...Right?!</i>

00:13:56.030 --> 00:13:58.730
I won't die!

00:14:01.470 --> 00:14:04.960
I'm not gonna die here.

00:14:05.970 --> 00:14:08.270
<i>Really, these guys...</i>

00:14:11.310 --> 00:14:14.840
Zoro!!

00:14:17.990 --> 00:14:21.320
<i>He should give up his ambition
rather than dying!</i>

00:14:21.320 --> 00:14:25.590
It should be easy...
to give up your ambition, right?!

00:14:34.670 --> 00:14:37.610
<i>They're all...</i>

00:14:48.680 --> 00:14:53.690
I don't know...

00:14:53.690 --> 00:14:56.390
I don't know why...

00:14:56.390 --> 00:15:00.330
but if I withdrew even a step, I feel
like those various important things

00:15:00.330 --> 00:15:02.500
such as pledges
and promises in the past

00:15:02.500 --> 00:15:06.970
will be shattered, and I won't be
able to come back to where I am now...

00:15:06.970 --> 00:15:12.640
He can be defeated by someone
with a spear of blind determination.

00:15:12.640 --> 00:15:19.550
I know an idiot who's holding back
that spear for a stupid reason...

00:15:37.670 --> 00:15:40.970
<i>All... Blue...</i>

00:15:48.680 --> 00:15:52.910
Hey, chore boy! Don't you die on me!

00:16:02.290 --> 00:16:04.630
Don! What's the matter?!

00:16:04.630 --> 00:16:07.630
Why was Don...

00:16:07.630 --> 00:16:10.100
Don Krieg has been defeated...

00:16:10.100 --> 00:16:14.970
This can't be true...
He's the ruler of the East Blue...

00:16:14.970 --> 00:16:22.980
That man is... That man is...
That man is... That man is...

00:16:22.980 --> 00:16:26.980
Even if you say so...
Just take a look at that!

00:16:26.980 --> 00:16:31.650
His proud armor got shattered
and he's knocked out.

00:16:31.650 --> 00:16:36.160
He got defeated good.
You're not gonna see it?

00:16:36.160 --> 00:16:43.030
He's the only man I admired...
I believed he was the strongest!

00:16:49.340 --> 00:16:51.010
Hey wait, underling!

00:16:51.010 --> 00:16:53.170
If you move around now,
the poison'll pass into your system.

00:16:53.170 --> 00:16:57.350
--Don't move around!
I'm saying this for your own good!
--Hey! You're gonna die!

00:16:57.350 --> 00:17:01.450
Chore boy! Don't die! Can you hear me?!

00:17:01.450 --> 00:17:04.950
You still have things to do, right?!

00:17:04.950 --> 00:17:08.290
Hey! Don't die! Chore boy!

00:17:08.290 --> 00:17:13.960
Say... Say something!!
Chore boy! Don't die!!

00:17:25.970 --> 00:17:27.970
You're such a...

00:17:29.310 --> 00:17:33.310
--You're really something else...
--I'm the strongest!!

00:17:33.310 --> 00:17:40.660
I win! No one defeats my force!!

00:17:40.660 --> 00:17:42.160
Don! Please stop!

00:17:42.160 --> 00:17:45.660
Hold him! He's not even conscious!

00:17:45.660 --> 00:17:49.660
--I'll win!!
--Please stop, Don!!

00:17:49.660 --> 00:17:53.470
I'll win! Using my force!!

00:18:00.510 --> 00:18:06.350
I... have to win!!

00:18:08.950 --> 00:18:12.320
I'm the strongest man!!

00:18:18.960 --> 00:18:23.300
Don Krieg... We lost.

00:18:23.300 --> 00:18:25.630
Chief Commander!

00:18:25.630 --> 00:18:30.160
Let's withdraw gracefully
and start afresh.

00:18:36.310 --> 00:18:39.150
<i>Thanks for everything, Sanji-san.</i>

00:18:39.150 --> 00:18:43.150
Sure. Don't ever come back!

00:18:43.150 --> 00:18:49.490
<i>Sanji-san, when he wakes up,
please tell him I said...</i>

00:18:52.330 --> 00:18:57.160
I'll see you again in the Grand Line.

00:18:57.160 --> 00:18:59.000
You...

00:18:59.000 --> 00:19:05.110
When I think about it carefully,
that's the only thing I want to do...

00:19:05.110 --> 00:19:11.170
It seems that Don Krieg's ambition
became mine as well before I knew it.

00:19:15.620 --> 00:19:21.120
Maybe... I can live only
a few more hours...

00:19:21.120 --> 00:19:25.130
It's kind of stupid that I'm resolved
because I don't have much time left,

00:19:25.130 --> 00:19:29.460
but this time, I want to do it
with my own will... in my own way...

00:19:29.460 --> 00:19:33.370
Then, there'll be nowhere
for me to escape, right?

00:19:39.310 --> 00:19:42.310
The hell with loyalty towards Don!

00:19:42.310 --> 00:19:48.650
I've just been running away using
Don Krieg's name as a shield...

00:19:48.650 --> 00:19:51.720
Once you're resolved,

00:19:51.720 --> 00:19:54.320
you don't have to think
about stupid things

00:19:54.320 --> 00:19:57.190
like fearing your enemy
or how to keep from getting hurt...

00:19:57.190 --> 00:20:00.360
I learned it from that guy.

00:20:04.330 --> 00:20:08.340
Patty! Carne!! Give him the boat
used to go grocery shopping!

00:20:08.340 --> 00:20:10.670
What?! Are you stupid?!

00:20:10.670 --> 00:20:14.010
Why do we have to
give our boat to pirates?!

00:20:14.010 --> 00:20:17.340
What's gonna happen to our
grocery shopping?! You idiot!

00:20:17.340 --> 00:20:20.680
He's right! Let those guys swim!

00:20:20.680 --> 00:20:23.850
Just bring it out already!!

00:20:27.190 --> 00:20:31.030
--Okay, we got it...
--Don't yell at us...

00:20:31.030 --> 00:20:34.660
Okay, okay, we'll bring it out!

00:20:42.040 --> 00:20:45.130
It's gonna sink!

00:20:57.220 --> 00:21:00.720
Why did I hesitate?
What was I so worried about?

00:21:00.720 --> 00:21:04.390
When I think about it, I feel stupid...

00:21:19.170 --> 00:21:22.840
Well, then! We gratefully
accept the boat.

00:21:22.840 --> 00:21:25.180
We don't have to return it, right?

00:21:25.180 --> 00:21:28.350
Right. If you have the courage
to come here to return it,

00:21:28.350 --> 00:21:30.680
try it, you small fry.

00:21:30.680 --> 00:21:34.190
He's right! Just keep this in your brain!!

00:21:34.190 --> 00:21:38.030
This is the sea restaurant Baratie,
where cooks fight!

00:21:38.030 --> 00:21:39.190
Yeah!!

00:21:39.190 --> 00:21:43.320
Hmph! What a scary restaurant...

00:22:25.170 --> 00:22:27.170
They were nice guys...

00:22:27.170 --> 00:22:32.480
I wonder if they'll let me join them
again when I see them next time...

00:22:44.690 --> 00:22:47.820
I wonder if I'll be able
to see them again...

00:22:50.700 --> 00:22:54.030
I wanna be free...

00:22:54.030 --> 00:22:56.070
<i>Bellemere-san...</i>

00:22:56.070 --> 00:23:06.070
<i>When I was little, I had
a vision of a treasure map</i>

00:23:10.280 --> 00:23:17.220
<i>and I always searched
for that miraculous place</i>

00:23:17.220 --> 00:23:24.390
<i>before someone else could
beat me to it</i>

00:23:27.000 --> 00:23:37.000
<i>If the world is going to change</i>

00:23:38.480 --> 00:23:45.490
<i>before I can even attain my dream</i>

00:23:45.490 --> 00:23:52.560
<i>then take me to the time
when I knew nothing</i>

00:23:52.560 --> 00:24:02.560
<i>so that my memories won't fade</i>
